  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup mayonnaise",
    "2 tablespoons sriracha sauce",
    "1 (16 ounce) jar dill pickle chips",
    "1 egg",
    "2 tablespoons milk",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 cup cornmeal",
    "0.5 teaspoon seasoned salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon paprika",
    "0.25 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "0.125 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "cooking spray"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Heat an air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lC_DoQ7veDm15qH-3XSLInXe4fs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267111-air-fryer-fried-pickles-VAT-step-01-257d2ec6046e48b185e4ce5809b59402.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267111/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the dipping sauce: Mix mayonnaise and sriracha sauce together in a small bowl until well combined. Refrigerate until ready to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VJa9eQR9FV3xGEsO3EDXkNANjt8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267111-air-fryer-fried-pickles-VAT-step-02-6dff5ae3fb304b008c7b20524e47969b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267111/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain pickles and dry them on paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y2xTaQZkf9H7GMuHqjGkejixFV8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267111-air-fryer-fried-pickles-VAT-step-03-224616f1fa684abf805f8010d68366ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267111/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix egg and milk together in a bowl. Mix flour, cornmeal, seasoned salt, paprika, garlic powder, and black pepper together in another bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3xSam0fHyyAaTNcNC4z_DjFBjZ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267111-air-fryer-fried-pickles-VAT-step-04-70708dda7fde4d7aba743bb75788fdeb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267111/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip sliced pickles in egg mixture, then in flour mixture, coating both sides and lightly pressing flour mixture into each pickle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OIeTkh1PB-VOTVoRZwjEP22bU-U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267111-air-fryer-fried-pickles-VAT-step-05-a1c6482717a3417fbd8094bbf408c723.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267111/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray the air fryer basket with cooking spray. Place pickles in the basket in a single layer; split into 2 batches if necessary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M-0ebtW0MUoKRwj3PWRWKAtUEVo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267111-air-fryer-fried-pickles-VAT-step-06-3ec877b4bbaa40f1858a9582c38cd964.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267111/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook for 4 minutes; carefully flip pickles. Cook until desired brownness, about 4 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IIX60hs2Ze4fbbD8cNr8WDa0-cs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267111-air-fryer-fried-pickles-VAT-step-07-c711c30bf9d44c0aaf063449b2384622.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267111/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with sriracha mayo.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_KAErma_rjMGQT8gkUfkq_6BGns=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267111-air-fryer-fried-pickles-VAT-Beauty-4x3-a481902ed96b4a5093451dbf7b6e45da.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267111/step_08.webp"
    }
